cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "InfoMergeCluster: Clustering of Sparse Longitudinal Data with Automatic Choice of the Number of Clusters"
abstract: >-
  R package for clustering sparse longitudinal trajectories with a mixture of
  linear mixed models whose mean curves are penalised B-splines, optionally with
  covariates, and automatic selection of the number of clusters (exact-ICL merge
  tree, SQUAREM-accelerated EM, BIC/ICL) or a number of clusters fixed by the user.
authors:
  - family-names: "Noukpoape"
    given-names: "Komlan Midodzi"
    email: "noukpoape@gmail.com"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-16"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/noukpoape/InfoMergeCluster"
url: "https://github.com/noukpoape/InfoMergeCluster"
keywords:
  - R
  - clustering
  - longitudinal data
  - mixed models
  - mixture models
  - B-splines
  - EM algorithm
  - model selection
